## Deployment Notes

Speed Insights is ready for production deployment. Once deployed to Vercel:
- The tracking script will automatically be served at `/_vercel/speed-insights/*`
- Metrics will be available in the Vercel dashboard under "Speed Insights"
- No additional configuration is required

## Conclusion

The Vercel Speed Insights integration is complete and follows best practices from the official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will start collecting performance metrics once deployed to Vercel.
